  "description": "Discover the intersection of tradition and modernity with Diloma, a striking blackletter-inspired display font.\nMerging the traditional elegance of calligraphy with the stark, raw aesthetics of brutalism, this font brings a unique fusion of history and modernity. Inspired by the sharp, precise strokes of flat-pen calligraphy, each character is crafted with rigid, angular forms that evoke the structured, geometric feel of brutalism while maintaining the intricate detail and ornate beauty of Old English typography.\nThe result is a typeface that’s both commanding and elegant, perfect for bold branding, editorial pieces, and statement-making designs. Ideal for those who want to combine the weight of tradition with a contemporary edge, Diloma adds a touch of grandeur and power to any project.\nWith PUA encoding included, all special characters and decorative elements are easily accessible without additional software.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Discover the intersection of tradition and modernity with Diloma, a striking blackletter-inspired display font.</strong></p>\n<p>Merging the traditional elegance of calligraphy with the stark, raw aesthetics of brutalism, this font brings a unique fusion of history and modernity. Inspired by the sharp, precise strokes of flat-pen calligraphy, each character is crafted with rigid, angular forms that evoke the structured, geometric feel of brutalism while maintaining the intricate detail and ornate beauty of Old English typography.</p>\n<p>The result is a typeface that’s both commanding and elegant, perfect for bold branding, editorial pieces, and statement-making designs. Ideal for those who want to combine the weight of tradition with a contemporary edge, Diloma adds a touch of grandeur and power to any project.</p>\n<p><strong>With PUA encoding included, all special characters and decorative elements are easily accessible without additional software.</strong></p>",
